# Board patches, one per line in application order.
#
# These live in ios-sweet/xnu/patches (that is where its CI looks) and are
# listed here so the board set is reviewable in one place. Numbering continues
# from upstream; the next free slot is 0090.

# HX83112A touch over GENI SPI, TLMM volume keys, PM660 PON power key.
0082-sweet-himax-touch.patch

# Console log flushes synchronously: without it the last lines before a hang
# never reach the persistent ring, which is all we have on a board with no UART.
0083-sweet-log-sync-flush.patch

# RPMh vote for the touch rail; the bootloader leaves it off.
0084-sweet-rpmh-rmx1971.patch

# USB bring-up. 0085-0088 are diagnostics + the two real fixes (core reset and
# the forced device role); 0089 is framebuffer source diag. Drop them once
# DWC3 enumerates and renumber.
0085-sweet-usb-dma-diag.patch
0086-sweet-usb-reset.patch
0087-sweet-fb-heartbeat.patch
0088-sweet-usb-devmode.patch
0089-sweet-fb-src-diag.patch
